        ]
    },
    "module_name": "frozenlist._frozenlist"
}
END: Cython Metadata */
...

Replace build path prefix with hardcode `build_path', it is no harm to tweak comments in source file, after applied this commit, vim frozenlist/_frozenlist.cpp
